# =============================================================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# =============================================================================
# 1. Copy this file as .env to the root directory of the Genius Project on each PC
# 2. Update the CORS_ORIGINS line to include the actual IP addresses of your LAN devices
# 3. Start the backend with: cd backend && source venv/bin/activate && python app.py
# 4. Access from any device: http://[IP_ADDRESS]:10000/api/brains
#
# CENTRALIZED APPROACH (RECOMMENDED):
# 1. Run backend only on one main PC (e.g., 192.168.100.63)
# 2. Point all frontend applications to the main backend URL
# 3. This ensures everyone sees the same brains without duplicate servers
